  "ps3.10:0.1": "",
  "ps3.10:0.2": "",
  "ps3.10:0.3": "3. 10. mātikā kathā ",
  "ps3.10:1.1": "nicchāto, mokkho vimokkho, vijjāvimutti, adhisīlaṃ, adhicittaṃ, adhipaññā, passaddhi, ñāṇaṃ, dassanaṃ, visuddhi, nekkhammaṃ, nissaraṇaṃ, paviveko, vossaggo, cariyā, jhānavimokkho, bhāvanā, adhiṭṭhānaṃ, jīvitaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:2.1": "nicchātoti nekkhammena kāmacchandato nicchāto, abyāpādena byāpādato nicchāto …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:2.2": "paṭhamena jhānena nīvaraṇehi nicchāto …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:2.3": "arahattamaggena sabbakilesehi nicchāto. ",
  "ps3.10:3.1": "mokkho vimokkhoti nekkhammena kāmacchandato muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:3.2": "mokkho vimokkho ",
  "ps3.10:3.3": "",
  "ps3.10:3.4": "…pe… ",
  "ps3.10:3.5": "paṭhamena jhānena nīvaraṇehi muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:3.6": "mokkho vimokkho …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:3.7": "arahattamaggena sabbakilesehi muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:3.8": "mokkho vimokkho. ",
  "ps3.10:4.1": "vijjāvimuttīti nekkhammaṃ vijjatīti vijjā, kāmacchandato muccatīti vimutti, ",
  "ps3.10:4.2": "vijjanto muccati, muccato vijjatīti ",
  "ps3.10:4.3": "vijjāvimutti. ",
  "ps3.10:4.4": "abyāpādo vijjatīti vijjā, byāpādato muccatīti vimutti, ",
  "ps3.10:4.5": "vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjatīti ",
  "ps3.10:4.6": "vijjāvimutti …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:4.7": "arahattamaggo vijjatīti vijjā, sabbakilesehi muccatīti vimutti, ",
  "ps3.10:4.8": "vijjanto muccati, muccanto vijjātīti ",
  "ps3.10:4.9": "vijjāvimutti. ",
  "ps3.10:5.1": "adhisīlaṃ adhicittaṃ adhipaññāti nekkhammena kāmacchandaṃ saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi, avikkhepaṭṭhena cittavisuddhi, dassanaṭṭhena diṭṭhivisuddhi. ",
  "ps3.10:5.2": "yo tattha saṃvaraṭṭho, ayaṃ adhisīlasikkhā. ",
  "ps3.10:5.3": "yo tattha avikkhepaṭṭho ayaṃ adhicittasikkhaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:5.4": "yo tattha dasasnaṭṭho ayaṃ adhipaññāsikkhā. ",
  "ps3.10:5.5": "abyāpādena byāpādaṃ saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:5.6": "arahattamaggena sabbakilese saṃvaraṭṭhena sīlavisuddhi, avikkhepaṭṭhena cittavisuddhi, ",
  "ps3.10:5.7": "dassanaṭṭhena diṭṭhivisuddhi. ",
  "ps3.10:5.8": "yo tattha saṃvaraṭṭho ayaṃ adhisīlasikkhā. ",
  "ps3.10:5.9": "yo tattha avikkhepaṭṭho ayaṃ adhicittasikkhā. ",
  "ps3.10:5.10": "yo tattha dassanaṭṭho ayaṃ adhipaññāsikkhā. ",
  "ps3.10:6.1": "passaddhīti nekkhammena kāmacchandaṃ paṭippassambheti, abyāpādena byāpādaṃ paṭippassambheti …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:6.2": "arahattamaggena sabbakilese paṭippassambheti. ",
  "ps3.10:7.1": "ñāṇanti kāmacchandassa pahīnattā nekkhammaṃ ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:7.2": "byāpādassa pahīnattā abyāpādo ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:7.3": "sabbakilesānaṃ pahīnattā arahattamaggo ñātaṭṭhena ñāṇaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:8.1": "dassananti kāmacchandassa pahīnattā nekkhammaṃ diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:8.2": "byāpādassa pahīnattā akhayāpādo diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:8.3": "sabbakilesānaṃ pahīnattā arahattamaggo diṭṭhattā dassanaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:9.1": "visuddhiti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammena visujjhati, ",
  "ps3.10:9.2": "byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādena visujjhati …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:9.3": "sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggena visujjhati. ",
  "ps3.10:10.1": "nekkhammanti kāmānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ yadidaṃ nekkhammaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:10.2": "rūpānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ yadidaṃ āruppaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:10.3": "yaṃ kho pana kiñci bhūtaṃ saṅkhataṃ paṭiccasamuppannaṃ, nirodho tassa nekkhammaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:10.4": "byāpādassa abyāpādo nekkhammaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:10.5": "thinamiddhassa ālokasaññā nekkhammaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:10.6": "sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo nekkhammaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:11.1": "nissaraṇanti kāmānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ yadidaṃ nekkhammaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:11.2": "rūpānametaṃ nissaraṇaṃ yadidaṃ āruppaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:11.3": "yaṃ kho pana kiñci bhūtaṃ saṅkhataṃ paṭiccasamuppannaṃ, nirodho tassa nissaraṇaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:11.4": "kāmacchandassa nekkhammaṃ nissaraṇaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:11.5": "byāpādassa abyāpādo nissaraṇaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:11.6": "sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo nissaraṇaṃ. ",
  "ps3.10:12.1": "pavivekoti kāmacchandassa nekkhammaṃ paviveko …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:12.2": "sabbakilesānaṃ arahattamaggo paviveko. ",
  "ps3.10:13.1": "vossaggoti nekkhamena kāmacchandaṃ vossajajjatīti ",
  "ps3.10:13.2": "vossaggo, ",
  "ps3.10:13.3": "abyāpādena byāpādaṃ vossajjatīti ",
  "ps3.10:13.4": "vossaggo …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:13.5": "arahattamaggena sabbakilese vossajjatīti ",
  "ps3.10:13.6": "vossaggo. ",
  "ps3.10:14.1": "cariyāti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammena carati, ",
  "ps3.10:14.2": "byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādena carati …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:14.3": "sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggena carati. ",
  "ps3.10:15.1": "jhānavimokkhoti nekkhammaṃ jhāyatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.2": "jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.3": "kāmacchandaṃ jhāpetīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.4": "jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.5": "jhāyanto muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.6": "jhānavimokkho ",
  "ps3.10:15.7": "jhāpento muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.8": "jhānavimokkho ",
  "ps3.10:15.9": "jhāyantīti dhammā, ",
  "ps3.10:15.10": "jhāpentīti kilese, ",
  "ps3.10:15.11": "jhāte ca jhāpe ca jānātīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.12": "jhānajhāyī. ",
  "ps3.10:15.13": "abyāpādo jhāyatīti jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.14": "byāpādaṃ jhāpetīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.15": "jhānaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:15.16": "ālokasaññā jhāyatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.17": "jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.18": "thinamiddhaṃ jhāpetīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.19": "jhānaṃ …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:15.20": "arahattamaggo jhāyatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.21": "jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.22": "sabbakilese jhāpetīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.23": "jhānaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:15.24": "jhāyanto muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.25": "jhānavimokkho ",
  "ps3.10:15.26": "jhāpento muccatīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.27": "jhānavimokkho, ",
  "ps3.10:15.28": "jhāyantīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.29": "dhammā, ",
  "ps3.10:15.30": "jhāpentīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.31": "kilese, ",
  "ps3.10:15.32": "jhāte ca jhāpe ca jānātīti ",
  "ps3.10:15.33": "jhānajhāyī. ",
  "ps3.10:16.1": "bhāvanā adhiṭṭhānaṃ jīvitanti kāmacchandaṃ pajahanto nekkhammaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:16.2": "bhāvanāsampanno, ",
  "ps3.10:16.3": "nekkhammavasena cittaṃ adhiṭṭhātīti ",
  "ps3.10:16.4": "adhiṭṭhānasampanno, ",
  "ps3.10:16.5": "svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno samaṃ jīvati, no visamaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:16.6": "sammā jīvati, no micchā, ",
  "ps3.10:16.7": "visuddhaṃ jīvati, no kiliṭṭhanti ",
  "ps3.10:16.8": "ājīvasampanno. ",
  "ps3.10:16.9": "svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno yaññadevaparisaṃ upasaṅkamati: ",
  "ps3.10:16.10": "yadi khattiyaparisaṃ yadi brāhmaṇaparisaṃ yadi gahapatiparisaṃ yadi samaṇaparisaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:16.11": "visārado upasaṅkamati amaṅkubhūto, ",
  "ps3.10:16.12": "taṃ kissa hetu; ",
  "ps3.10:16.13": "tathā hi so bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno. ",
  "ps3.10:17.1": "byāpādaṃ pajahanto abyāpādaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.2": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.3": "thīnamiddhaṃ pajahanto ālokasaññaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.4": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.5": "uddhaccaṃ pajahanto avikkhepaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.6": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.7": "vicikicchaṃ pajahanto dhammavavatthānaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.8": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.9": "avijjaṃ pajahanto vijjaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.10": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.11": "aratiṃ pajahanto pāmojjaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.12": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.13": "nīvaraṇe pajahanto paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.14": "bhāvanāsampanno …pe… ",
  "ps3.10:17.15": "sabbakilese pajahanto arahattamaggaṃ bhāvetīti ",
  "ps3.10:17.16": "bhāvanāsampanno. ",
  "ps3.10:17.17": "arahattamaggavasena cittaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:17.18": "adhiṭṭhānasampanno, ",
  "ps3.10:17.19": "svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno samaṃ jīvati, no visamaṃ, ",
  "ps3.10:17.20": "sammā jīvati, no micchā, ",
  "ps3.10:17.21": "visuddhaṃ jīvati, no kiliṭṭhanti ",
  "ps3.10:17.22": "ājīvasampanno. ",
  "ps3.10:17.23": "svāyaṃ evaṃ bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampanno yaññadeva parisaṃ upasaṅkamati ",
  "ps3.10:17.24": "yadi khattiyaparisaṃ yadi brāhmaṇaparisaṃ yadi gahapatiparisaṃ yadi samaṇaparisaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:17.25": "visārado upasaṅkamati amaṅkubhūto, ",
  "ps3.10:17.26": "taṃ kissa hetu: ",
  "ps3.10:17.27": "tathā hi so bhāvanāsampanno adhiṭṭhānasampanno ājīvasampannoti. ",
  "ps3.10:17.28": "mātikākathā samattā. ",
  "ps3.10:17.29": "paññāvaggo tatiyo. ",
  "ps3.10:17.30": "tatruddānaṃ bhavati: ",
  "ps3.10:18.1": "paññā iddhi abhisamayo - ",
  "ps3.10:18.2": "viveko cariya pañcamo ",
  "ps3.10:18.3": "pāṭihāriya samasīsi - ",
  "ps3.10:18.4": "satipaṭṭhānaṃ vipassanā ",
  "ps3.10:18.5": "paññāvaggamhi tatiye - ",
  "ps3.10:18.6": "mātikāya ca te dasāti. ",
  "ps3.10:19.1": "paṭisambhidāmaggappakaraṇaṃ ",
  "ps3.10:19.2": "",
  "ps3.10:19.3": "",
  "ps3.10:19.4": "",
  "ps3.10:20.1": "",
  "ps3.10:20.2": "samattaṃ. ",
